(pleased with her\054 about the Prophet \050s\056a\056v\056\051 reading the Qur\047an in her lap while) Tj
T*
(she was menstruating\054 it is a hadith of legislation\054 not a hadith of a binding\054) Tj
T*
(obligatory Sunnah to be followed and always keenly practiced\054 with the hadith) Tj
T*
(taken as a concession to lie down and read the Book of Allah\054 and that) Tj
T*
-0.026976 Tw
(considered a Sunnah whose practice is preferred over reading while sitting\056 It is a) Tj
T*
0 Tw
(hadith of legislation\054 and of the permissibility that the Muslim woman in a state of) Tj
T*
(menstruation is not) Tj
T*
ET
Q
Q
Q

